      "content": "\"letting the current end\"... what does that even mean? the way you're saying it, it almost sounds like you're saying I should just stop fighting. like instead of trying to fix this broken life, i should just give up and let the silence take over. is that what you're saying? that it's okay to just... go quiet?",
